            <div class="style-guide_row"><p class="heading-style-h1">Know what it costs</p><div class="style-guide_meta"><p class="style-guide_label">heading-style-h1 · H1</p><p class="style-guide_code">3.75 / 3 / 2.5 / 2.25rem · 600 · 1.15</p></div></div>
            <div class="style-guide_row"><p class="heading-style-h2">The costly clauses</p><div class="style-guide_meta"><p class="style-guide_label">heading-style-h2 · H2</p><p class="style-guide_code">3 / 2.5 / 2.125rem · 600 · 1.15 · balance</p></div></div>
            <div class="style-guide_row"><p class="heading-style-h3">Try it before you pay</p><div class="style-guide_meta"><p class="style-guide_label">heading-style-h3 · case study titles</p><p class="style-guide_code">2.5 / 2 / 1.75rem · 600 · 1.15</p></div></div>
