            <div class="style-guide_row"><p class="text-color-secondary">Every section in plain English, on one page.</p><div class="style-guide_meta"><p class="style-guide_label">p tag · no size class</p><p class="style-guide_code">1.125rem · 1.5 · inherits the body</p></div></div>
            <div class="style-guide_row"><p class="text-size-small text-color-secondary">PDF or Word, up to 30 pages</p><div class="style-guide_meta"><p class="style-guide_label">text-size-small</p><p class="style-guide_code">0.9375rem · 1.45 · color from text-color-secondary</p></div></div>
